OL,3,AAcademic says he has been barred from
OL,4,AUK over event with Palestine Action
OL,5,Afounder
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Swedish climate academic says he has
OL,8,Fbeen barred from entering the UK
OL,9,Fbecause he was due to speak on a panel
OL,10,Fwith a co-founder of Palestine Action.
OL,12,FAndreas Malm told BBC Radio 4's Today
OL,13,Fprogramme that he had received a letter
OL,14,Ffrom the Home Office notifying him that
OL,15,Fhis presence was "not conducive to the
OL,16,Fpublic good", with no further details
OL,17,Fgiven.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
