OL,3,AAcademic says he has been barred from
OL,4,AUK over event with Palestine Action
OL,5,Afounder
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said he could not "see any other
OL,8,Fexplanation" for being denied entry
OL,9,Fthan his scheduled appearance with Huda
OL,10,FAmmori, a founder of the group, which
OL,11,Fis a proscribed terrorist organisation
OL,12,Fin the UK.
OL,14,FThe Home Office said it did not comment
OL,15,Fon individual cases.
